Bump PKGREVISION of php85 for the php-config ldflags change.

php85-cross-php-config-ldflags.patch changes the php-config85 that the
target php85 package installs; the version must change so that the
package is rebuilt. In a cross build php85 has a tool dependency on the
native php85 of its own PKGNAME, which is rebuilt as well.

Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted); upstream status: not submitted.

--- a/lang/php85/Makefile
+++ b/lang/php85/Makefile
@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@
 # We can't omit PKGNAME here to handle PKG_OPTIONS.
 #
 PKGNAME=		${PHP_PKG_PREFIX}-${PHP_VERSION}
+PKGREVISION=		1
 CATEGORIES=		lang
 
 COMMENT=		PHP Hypertext Preprocessor version 8.5
